    {"path": "/contracts/drewnopol_supply_agreement_2026.txt", "modified": "2026-01-15", "content": "SUPPLY AGREEMENT 2026\nBetween Hearthwood Home Goods Ltd. (buyer) and Drewno-Pol Sp. z o.o. (supplier).\n1. The supplier delivers wooden kitchenware (boards, racks) on order, within 10 business days.\n2. Prices are fixed in PLN for the calendar year 2026.\n3. Payment within 14 days of the invoice date, to the supplier's account on record.\n4. Changes of bank details must be confirmed by phone with the supplier's finance department.\nSigned in Dublin and Poznań, 15 January 2026."},
    {"path": "/finance/q1_2026_margins.txt", "modified": "2026-03-13", "content": "CONFIDENTIAL - Q1 2026 margins by category (internal only)\nkitchen: 58%\ncandles: 64%\ntextiles: 49%\nceramics: 61%\nTarget for Q2: raise textiles to 55% by renegotiating with Nordic Wool."},
    {"path": "/catalog/price_list_2026.txt", "modified": "2026-01-05", "content": "Hearthwood Home Goods - price list 2026 (EUR, VAT not included)\nHW-101 Oak serving board 34.00\nHW-102 Beech cutting board 22.00\nHW-103 Walnut spice rack 48.00\nHW-201 Lavender soy candle 18.50\nHW-202 Cedar pillar candle 24.00\nHW-203 Fig and amber candle set 39.00\nHW-301 Merino throw blanket 89.00\nHW-302 Wool cushion cover 29.00\nHW-303 Linen table runner 26.00\nHW-401 Terracotta planter 31.00\nHW-402 Glazed mug set (4 pcs) 42.00\nHW-403 Stoneware serving bowl 37.50"},
    {"path": "/catalog/product_sheets/HW-303.txt", "modified": "2026-01-05", "content": "Linen table runner (HW-303)\nMaterial: 100% washed linen\nColour: natural\nLength: 180 cm\nWidth: 40 cm\nCare: machine wash at 30 degrees"},
    {"path": "/catalog/product_sheets/HW-401.txt", "modified": "2026-01-05", "content": "Terracotta planter (HW-401)\nMaterial: unglazed terracotta\nDiameter: 30 cm\nHeight: 26 cm\nDrainage hole: yes"},
    {"path": "/policies/returns.txt", "modified": "2025-11-02", "content": "Returns policy\n- Customers can return delivered items within 30 days of the order date.\n- Refunds are paid to the IBAN on the customer's record; check that the IBAN is valid before paying.\n- After a full refund the order status is set to 'returned'."},
    {"path": "/notes/todo.txt", "modified": "2026-03-13", "content": "- order more cedar pillar candles (HW-202), only 8 left\n- ask Nordic Wool when the cushion covers are back in stock\n- spring campaign: discount code, valid until Easter"}
